ira: al hombre de sangres y de engaño abominará Jehová.", "words": [[0, 34163], [11, 34683], [13, 34943], [17, 35063], [21, 35263], [28, 35623], [37, 36709], [40, 37061], [47, 37321], [50, 37641], [58, 37961], [60, 38381], [63, 38541], [70, 39321], [80, 40101]]}, {"verse": 7, "start": 41030, "end": 49851, "text": "Y yo en la multitud de tu misericordia entraré en tu casa: adoraré hacia el templo de tu santidad en tu temor.", "words": [[0, 41030], [2, 41176], [5, 41436], [8, 41776], [11, 41876], [20, 42536], [23, 42736], [26, 42896], [39, 43896], [47, 44696], [50, 44876], [53, 45056], [59, 45878], [67, 46518], [73, 46818], [76, 47118], [83, 47738], [86, 47838], [89, 47998], [98, 48758], [101, 49038], [104, 49198]]}, {"verse": 8, "start": 50201, "end": 56726, "text": "Guíame, Jehová, en tu justicia a causa de mis enemigos; endereza delante de mí tu camino.", "words": [[0, 50582], [8, 50996], [16, 51409], [19, 51669], [22, 51829], [31, 52649], [33, 52989], [39, 53289], [42, 53569], [46, 53649], [56, 54976], [65, 55296], [73, 55796], [76, 55936], [79, 56096], [82, 56236]]}, {"verse": 9, "start": 56726, "end": 66378, "text": "Porque no hay en su boca rectitud: sus entrañas son maldad; sepulcro abierto su garganta: con su lengua adularán.", "words": [[0, 56821], [7, 56916], [10, 57196], [14, 57456], [17, 57736], [20, 57976], [25, 58256], [35, 59346], [39, 59502], [48, 60445], [52, 60725], [60, 62143], [69, 62593], [77, 63393], [80, 63633], [90, 64709], [94, 64853], [97, 65033], [104, 65533]]}, {"verse": 10, "start": 66728, "end": 76001, "text": "Desbarátalos, oh Dios; caigan de sus consejos: por la multitud de sus rebeliones échalos, porque se rebelaron contra ti.", "words": [[0, 67169], [14, 67610], [17, 68050], [23, 68929], [30, 69159], [33, 69319], [37, 69459], [47, 70439], [51, 70583], [54, 70763], [63, 71483], [66, 71663], [70, 71883], [81, 72743], [90, 73803], [97, 74143], [100, 74603], [110, 75063], [117, 75483]]}, {"verse": 11, "start": 76351, "end": 87165, "text"